<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:commit:888fcadf3564b60bd485b6b74af2a8da5b92dcc9> <https://caviri.github.io/c4-model-agentic-plugin/ontology/c4-history#parentSha> "3c3bfe2a359a0cf59f87b007fb765f13764c3c25" .
<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:commit:888fcadf3564b60bd485b6b74af2a8da5b92dcc9> <https://caviri.github.io/c4-model-agentic-plugin/ontology/c4-history#message> "Add C4 model plugin: exploration, deck and architecture explorer skills\n\nThree skills and one command that explore a codebase and generate a\nreveal.js explainer deck and an interactive C4 architecture explorer\nwith JSON-LD and .rete export. Includes a theoretical image annotation\nproject as a test fixture, with the output generated for it, and\nREADME screenshots taken from that output." .
<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:commit:888fcadf3564b60bd485b6b74af2a8da5b92dcc9> <https://caviri.github.io/c4-model-agentic-plugin/ontology/c4-history#authoredAtTime> "2026-11-19T11:57:25Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
