<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:list:api:noteList:2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> "Published on host port 8000; OpenAPI docs at /docs. GET /api/health is the only route without auth besides login." <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:version:888fcadf3564b60bd485b6b74af2a8da5b92dcc9> .
