<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:scenario:annotate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An annotator claims the oldest pending task, draws boxes and submits it. Status: pending → in_progress → submitted." <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:version:1e415ac8413eb9e53fd1e596e04e3bb446097b15> .
