<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:scenario:annotate> <https://caviri.github.io/c4-model-agentic-plugin/ontology/c4#goal> "Get the next image annotated with labelled boxes and handed over for review." <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:version:1e415ac8413eb9e53fd1e596e04e3bb446097b15> .
<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:scenario:annotate> <https://caviri.github.io/c4-model-agentic-plugin/ontology/c4#trigger> "The annotator opens /annotate, which asks the API for the next task." <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:version:1e415ac8413eb9e53fd1e596e04e3bb446097b15> .
<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:scenario:annotate> <https://caviri.github.io/c4-model-agentic-plugin/ontology/c4#precondition> "Signed in with the annotator role: POST /api/tasks/next and POST /api/tasks/{id}/submit require it." <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:version:1e415ac8413eb9e53fd1e596e04e3bb446097b15> .
<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:scenario:annotate> <https://caviri.github.io/c4-model-agentic-plugin/ontology/c4#precondition> "A task is pending, or the annotator already has one in progress; otherwise the API answers 404 \"no pending tasks\"." <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:version:1e415ac8413eb9e53fd1e596e04e3bb446097b15> .
<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:scenario:annotate> <https://caviri.github.io/c4-model-agentic-plugin/ontology/c4-view#preconditionList> <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:list:scenario:annotate:preconditionList:1> <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:version:1e415ac8413eb9e53fd1e596e04e3bb446097b15> .
