<urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:list:scenario:annotate:preconditionList:1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:list:scenario:annotate:preconditionList:2> <urn:architecture:image-annotation-tool:version:1e415ac8413eb9e53fd1e596e04e3bb446097b15> .
